# Verification & EvalOps Director (`verification-eval`)

- Run `.cursor/skills/verification-director/tools/verify_cpu_scanner.py --target . --sarif-out verify_cpu_scanner.sarif` before semantic review.
- Ingest JUnit XML, LCOV/coverage JSON, and mutation JSON via `.cursor/skills/verification-director/tools/eval_ingest.py` (fail-closed exit `3` when `tests_executed == 0`).
- Escalate mock-heavy tests, missing negative auth regressions, holdout contamination, or uncalibrated LLM judges to read-only Clean-Room auditors (`auditor-test-integrity`, `auditor-evalops-validity`).
- Emit `Verdict Envelope v1.2.0` (`BLOCKER >= 1 -> REJECT`, `MAJOR >= 1 -> ITERATE`, else `SHIP`).
